WEBVTT

00:12:59.368 --> 00:13:01.853
We did it. I didn't do it. We did it.

00:13:01.877 --> 00:13:04.654
And we'll never forget it.
It'll always be part of us.

00:13:05.181 --> 00:13:09.199
The three things I did sort of blurt out
when we got there, was first:

00:13:09.223 --> 00:13:11.386
Never, ever give up.

00:13:12.550 --> 00:13:13.952
I live it.

00:13:13.976 --> 00:13:16.275
What's the phrase
from today from Socrates?

00:13:16.867 --> 00:13:18.063
Audience: To be is to do.

00:13:18.087 --> 00:13:19.395
Diana Nyad: To be is to do.

00:13:19.419 --> 00:13:22.408
So I don't stand up and say,
"Don't ever give up."

00:13:22.432 --> 00:13:23.784
I didn't give up.

00:13:24.341 --> 00:13:26.268
There was action behind these words.

00:13:26.292 --> 00:13:27.986
The second is:

00:13:28.010 --> 00:13:31.286
You can chase your dreams
at any age; you're never too old.